# Everything is excluded except what the server image is built from.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/lazy-domain
!crates/lazy-protocol
!crates/lazy-server
# The web client (D47): the shared client core, the crate, its build script, and the icon and fonts
# it shares with the desktop app (only those three families; not the emoji font).
!crates/lazy-client-core
!crates/lazy-web
!scripts/build-web.sh
!branding/icons/favicon.svg
!crates/lazy-ui/assets/fonts/dm-sans
!crates/lazy-ui/assets/fonts/nunito
!crates/lazy-ui/assets/fonts/lilex
# The server signs drop-in join tokens with the media library's token format (rtc-proto).
!media/Cargo.toml
!media/crates/rtc-proto
# ...and not the build output inside them.
**/target
